    "section": "04. Making Attacks",
    "ruleNumber": "04.01",
    "summary": "Pick the weapons model by model. Shooting allows several ranged weapons, subject to restrictions such as [CLOSE-QUARTERS]. A fighter picks one melee weapon. Choose one profile for each selected weapon with alternatives. A Hunter profile limits targets by keyword. Use the selected profile for resolution, carrying applicable attack changes through the attack sequence and its follow-on effects.",
